            "title": "Planning Manager | HG Construction",
            "country_flag": "",
            "testimonial_text": "\"We're finishing some projects many months ahead of programme, which is excellent achievement given their complexity. Powerproject has been a major contributor to this success.\""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_8LdM6q": {
